ground-renders/

# The balance console (`pnpm balance:sheet`). 1.3MB of catalogue inlined into one page so it opens
# straight off disk; regenerated from the catalogues whenever it is wanted, so nothing is lost by
# leaving it out of the tree.
docs/balance-sheet.html
